## 2. Purpose

Belyaev DNT is designed to improve users' privacy and security while
using the Internet, including limiting digital tracking, unwanted
advertising, trackers, potentially dangerous links, pop-up windows and
other web threats.

> The Software does not guarantee absolute anonymity, confidentiality,
> security, freedom from tracking, or protection against all types of
> cyber threats.

